					<p class="eyebrow">Where the money is</p>
					<h2 id="money-h">Every {nextYear} Senate, House and governor race, live</h2>
					<p>Each line runs from Washington to a race: Senate and governor races to the state, House races to a point inside it. Its color is the party the markets favor, and the brighter the pulse, the more money has traded on it. When a trade happens on Polymarket, it flashes down that race's line as it happens.</p>
					<div class="legend-dark"><span><i style="background:#5e92ee"></i>Democrat favored</span><span><i style="background:#e85a4c"></i>Republican favored</span><span><i style="background:#c9cdd5"></i>Independent</span></div>
